# Devops/operations properties override file for ds-present.
#
# This is the explicit, per-service override file configured via the 'application-properties-config' Tomcat
# context environment entry (see conf/ocp/ds-present.xml) / Jetty EnvEntry (see src/test/jetty/jetty-env.xml),
# and loaded by ServiceConfig.initializeWithPropertiesOverride(configFile, propertiesOverrideFile). It is meant
# for devops/operations secrets and per-environment values that must never be committed to git.
#
# Copy this file to 'ds-present-application.properties' (same folder, without the '.SAMPLE' suffix) and fill in
# your own values. This filename is already covered by the repository's generic '*-application.properties'
# .gitignore rule.
#
# NOTE: only simple/scalar settings can be overridden here - this file affects ServiceConfig.getFlatConfig() only,
# not the nested origins/storages/views/transformers configuration (ServiceConfig.getConfig()), which is not
# readable through the flat properties syntax. See ServiceConfig's class javadoc for why. Environment-specific
# overrides for the nested tree still go in a separate YAML file, merged via the 'application-config' glob
# (see conf/ocp/ds-present.xml).
#
# Any flat key present in ds-present-behaviour.yaml can be overridden here, using the same dotted path. The keys
# below are the ones commonly set per environment/operator - uncomment and set the ones you need.

# licensemodule.url=http://example.com:9076/ds-license/v1
# licensemodule.allowall=false

# openapi.serverurl=http://localhost:9073/ds-present/v1

# oldimageserver.url=http://example.com

# security.client.secret=changeme
